  "description": "<p>The <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/_/openjdk\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">openjdk image</a> (currently <tt>openjdk:9-jdk11-slim</tt> is used) has been deprecated and the <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/_/maven\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">maven image</a> (currently <tt>maven:3-openjdk-11-slim</tt> is used) has switched to Eclipse Temurin by default now.</p>\n\n<p>The following images should be used from now on:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Stage <tt>build</tt>: <tt>maven:3-eclipse-temurin-11</tt></li>\n\t<li>Stage <tt>app</tt>: <tt>eclipse-temurin:11-jre</tt></li>\n</ol>\n",
